// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x002AD8C9 size=113 name=?setScienceAvailability@Player@@QAEXW4ScienceType@@W4ScienceAvailabilityType@@@Z evidence=N:ledger tier=A
void Player::setScienceAvailability(ScienceType science, ScienceAvailabilityType availability)
{
	// a science sits in at most one of the two lists: take it out first
	Bool removed = false;
	_STL::vector<ScienceType>::iterator entry;
	for (entry = m_sciencesDisabled.begin(); entry != m_sciencesDisabled.end(); ++entry)
	{
		if (*entry == science)
		{
			m_sciencesDisabled.erase(entry);
			removed = true;
			break;
		}
	}
	if (!removed)
	{
		for (entry = m_sciencesHidden.begin(); entry != m_sciencesHidden.end(); ++entry)
		{
			if (*entry == science)
			{
				m_sciencesHidden.erase(entry);
				break;
			}
		}
	}

	if (availability == SCIENCE_DISABLED)
		m_sciencesDisabled.push_back(science);
	else if (availability == SCIENCE_HIDDEN)
		m_sciencesHidden.push_back(science);
}

// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x002AD93A size=195 name=?onUpgradeCompleted@Player@@QAEXPBVUpgradeTemplate@@H@Z evidence=N:ledger tier=A
void Player::onUpgradeCompleted(const UpgradeTemplate *upgradeTemplate, Int silent)
{
	for (ProtoList::iterator it = m_playerTeamPrototypes.begin(); it != m_playerTeamPrototypes.end(); ++it)
	{
		for (DLINK_ITERATOR<Team> iter = (*it)->iterate_TeamInstanceList(); !iter.done(); iter.advance())
		{
			Team *team = iter.cur();
			if (team == NULL)
				continue;
			for (DLINK_ITERATOR<Object> iterObj = team->iterate_TeamMemberList(); !iterObj.done(); iterObj.advance())
			{
				Object *obj = iterObj.cur();
				if (obj == NULL)
					continue;
				obj->updateUpgradeModules();
			}
		}
	}
	if (upgradeTemplate && !silent)
	{
		EvaEventID evaEvent = (EvaEventID)-1;
		Player *localPlayer = ThePlayerList->getLocalPlayer();
		if (this == localPlayer)
			evaEvent = upgradeTemplate->m_localPlayerGainsUpgradeEvaEvent;
		else if (localPlayer && m_defaultTeam)
		{
			if (localPlayer->getRelationship(m_defaultTeam) == ALLIES)
				evaEvent = upgradeTemplate->m_alliedPlayerGainsUpgradeEvaEvent;
			else
				evaEvent = upgradeTemplate->m_enemyPlayerGainsUpgradeEvaEvent;
		}
		TheEva->reportEvaEvent(evaEvent, NULL, NULL);
	}
}

// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x002AD9FD size=198 name=?onUpgradeRemoved@Player@@QAEXPBVUpgradeTemplate@@H@Z evidence=N:ledger tier=A
void Player::onUpgradeRemoved(const UpgradeTemplate *upgradeTemplate, Int silent)
{
	for (ProtoList::iterator it = m_playerTeamPrototypes.begin(); it != m_playerTeamPrototypes.end(); ++it)
	{
		for (DLINK_ITERATOR<Team> iter = (*it)->iterate_TeamInstanceList(); !iter.done(); iter.advance())
		{
			Team *team = iter.cur();
			if (team == NULL)
				continue;
			for (DLINK_ITERATOR<Object> iterObj = team->iterate_TeamMemberList(); !iterObj.done(); iterObj.advance())
			{
				Object *obj = iterObj.cur();
				if (obj == NULL)
					continue;
				obj->removeUpgrade(upgradeTemplate);
			}
		}
	}
	if (upgradeTemplate && !silent)
	{
		EvaEventID evaEvent = (EvaEventID)-1;
		Player *localPlayer = ThePlayerList->getLocalPlayer();
		if (this == localPlayer)
			evaEvent = upgradeTemplate->m_localPlayerLosesUpgradeEvaEvent;
		else if (localPlayer && m_defaultTeam)
		{
			if (localPlayer->getRelationship(m_defaultTeam) == ALLIES)
				evaEvent = upgradeTemplate->m_alliedPlayerLosesUpgradeEvaEvent;
			else
				evaEvent = upgradeTemplate->m_enemyPlayerLosesUpgradeEvaEvent;
		}
		TheEva->reportEvaEvent(evaEvent, NULL, NULL);
	}
}

// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x002ADAC3 size=140 name=?removeUpgrade@Player@@QAEXPBVUpgradeTemplate@@H@Z evidence=N:ledger tier=A
void Player::removeUpgrade(const UpgradeTemplate *upgradeTemplate, Int x)
{
	if (upgradeTemplate->getUpgradeType() == UPGRADE_TYPE_OBJECT)
	{
		onUpgradeRemoved(upgradeTemplate, x);
		return;
	}

	Upgrade *upgrade = findUpgrade(upgradeTemplate);
	if (upgrade)
	{
		if (upgrade->friend_getNext())
			upgrade->friend_getNext()->friend_setPrev(upgrade->friend_getPrev());
		if (upgrade->friend_getPrev())
			upgrade->friend_getPrev()->friend_setNext(upgrade->friend_getNext());
		else
			m_upgradeList = upgrade->friend_getNext();

		UnsignedInt oldBit = upgradeTemplate->getMaskIndex();
		m_upgradesInProgress.m_bits[oldBit >> 5] &= ~(1u << (oldBit & 31));
		oldBit = upgradeTemplate->getMaskIndex();
		m_upgradesCompleted.m_bits[oldBit >> 5] &= ~(1u << (oldBit & 31));

		if (upgrade->getStatus() == UPGRADE_STATUS_COMPLETE)
			onUpgradeRemoved(upgradeTemplate, x);
	}
}

