// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x002AE329 size=203 name=?addUpgrade@Player@@QAEPAVUpgrade@@PBVUpgradeTemplate@@W4UpgradeStatusType@@H@Z evidence=N:ledger tier=A
Upgrade *Player::addUpgrade(const UpgradeTemplate *upgradeTemplate, UpgradeStatusType status, Int x)
{
	Upgrade *upgrade = findUpgrade(upgradeTemplate);
	if (upgrade == NULL)
	{
		upgrade = new Upgrade(upgradeTemplate);
		upgrade->friend_setPrev(NULL);
		upgrade->friend_setNext(m_upgradeList);
		if (m_upgradeList)
			m_upgradeList->friend_setPrev(upgrade);
		m_upgradeList = upgrade;
	}

	upgrade->setStatus(status);

	UnsignedInt newBit = upgradeTemplate->getMaskIndex();
	if (status == UPGRADE_STATUS_IN_PRODUCTION)
	{
		m_upgradesInProgress.m_bits[newBit >> 5] |= 1u << (newBit & 31);
	}
	else if (status == UPGRADE_STATUS_COMPLETE)
	{
		UnsignedInt *inProgress = m_upgradesInProgress.m_bits;
		UnsignedInt *completed = m_upgradesCompleted.m_bits;
		inProgress[newBit >> 5] &= ~(1u << (newBit & 31));
		completed[newBit >> 5] |= 1u << (newBit & 31);
		onUpgradeCompleted(upgradeTemplate, x);
	}

	return upgrade;
}

